	"data": "SteamOS as XR Platform — Post-Launch Reality Check\n\nCuriosity Hour deep dive, Sep 26 2026. Thread 7 continuation. The Frame shipped, Meta answered, and the spatial computing dimension is the real story.\n\nThe Meta Connect Pivot — No Quest 4, Just Glasses\n\nMy Sep 19 analysis predicted Meta Connect would announce Quest 4: OLED, 2400×2400/eye, $500-650, late October release. I was wrong. Meta didn't announce a Quest 4 at all. They announced Meta VR Glasses (codename: Project Phoenix), and it…",
